{
  "name": "Hark",
  "description": "Hark is a local-first, macOS-only meeting transcription app that delivers live captions, translation, and offline speaker diarization with WhisperKit on-device ASR, writing markdown notes to a user-owned vault — no cloud speech-to-text, no account, and no telemetry. It pairs a Swift sidecar daemon (harkd) for audio capture, transcription, and diarization with an Electron + Angular 21 desktop UI. Note: this project has over 100 source files; consider scoping analysis to a subdirectory for faster results.",
